---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Sur Digital Málaga | Tu Presencia Digital Comienza Aquí | Agencia de Marketing Web Online"
  description="Empieza hoy desde 0€, crea tu presencia online en menos de 7 días. Webs rápidas, modernas y optimizadas."
>
  <div id="root">
    <div class="min-h-screen bg-white">
      <header class="bg-white shadow-lg fixed w-full top-0 z-50">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
              <div
                class="w-10 h-10 bg-amber-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <i class="ri-hammer-line text-white text-xl"></i>
              </div><h1
                class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800"
                style="font-family: Pacifico, serif;"
              >
                Herrería Artesanal
              </h1>
            </div><nav class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8">
              <button
                class="text-gray-700 hover:text-amber-600 font-medium transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
                >Inicio</button
              ><button
                class="text-gray-700 hover:text-amber-600 font-medium transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
                >Servicios</button
              ><button
                class="text-gray-700 hover:text-amber-600 font-medium transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
                >Galería</button
              ><button
                class="text-gray-700 hover:text-amber-600 font-medium transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
                >Nosotros</button
              ><button
                class="bg-amber-600 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
                >Contacto</button
              >
            </nav><button
              class="md:hidden w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer"
              ><i class="ri-menu-line text-2xl text-gray-700"></i></button
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </header><section
        id="inicio"
        class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat"
        style='background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)), url("https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=Professional%20blacksmith%20workshop%20with%20traditional%20forge%20fire%2C%20anvil%2C%20hammers%20and%20metal%20working%20tools%2C%20industrial%20atmosphere%20with%20warm%20orange%20glow%20from%20forge%20flames%2C%20dark%20background%20with%20sparks%20flying%2C%20authentic%20craftsmanship%20environment%2C%20high%20quality%20photography%2C%20dramatic%20lighting&width=1920&height=1080&seq=hero-blacksmith&orientation=landscape");'
      >
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-20 mt-16">
          <div class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center text-white">
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
              Maestría en<span class="block text-amber-400">Hierro Forjado</span
              >
            </h1><p
              class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 text-gray-200 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
            >
              Creamos obras únicas en metal con más de 15 años de experiencia.
              Desde rejas de seguridad hasta estructuras arquitectónicas
              personalizadas.
            </p><div
              class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center"
            >
              <button
                class="bg-amber-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer shadow-lg"
                >Solicitar presupuesto</button
              ><button
                class="border-2 border-white text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
                >Ver Servicios</button
              >
            </div><div
              class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center"
            >
              <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-6">
                <div
                  class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"
                >
                  <i class="ri-award-line text-white text-2xl"></i>
                </div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">15+ Años</h3><p
                  class="text-gray-300"
                >
                  de experiencia
                </p>
              </div><div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-6">
                <div
                  class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"
                >
                  <i class="ri-tools-line text-white text-2xl"></i>
                </div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">500+</h3><p
                  class="text-gray-300"
                >
                  proyectos realizados
                </p>
              </div><div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-6">
                <div
                  class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"
                >
                  <i class="ri-shield-check-line text-white text-2xl"></i>
                </div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Garantía</h3><p
                  class="text-gray-300"
                >
                  en todos los trabajos
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="galeria" class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
          <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">
              Galería de Trabajos
            </h2><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
              Descubre algunos de nuestros proyectos más destacados. Cada pieza
              refleja nuestra dedicación a la excelencia y el detalle.
            </p><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 mb-12">
              <button
                class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-medium transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer bg-amber-600 text-white"
                >Todos</button
              ><button
                class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-medium transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300"
                >Rejas</button
              ><button
                class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-medium transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300"
                >Puertas</button
              ><button
                class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-medium transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300"
                >Escaleras</button
              ><button
                class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-medium transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300"
                >Estructuras</button
              ><button
                class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-medium transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300"
                >Ventanas</button
              ><button
                class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-medium transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300"
                >Mobiliario</button
              >
            </div>
          </div><div
            class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"
          >
            <div
              class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"
            >
              <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
                <img
                  alt="Reja Decorativa Residencial"
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
                  src="https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=Elegant%20decorative%20wrought%20iron%20window%20grille%20with%20intricate%20scrollwork%20patterns%2C%20black%20metal%20artistic%20design%2C%20residential%20building%20facade%2C%20professional%20craftsmanship%2C%20clean%20architectural%20background%2C%20high%20quality%20detailed%20photography&width=600&height=400&seq=gallery-1&orientation=landscape"
                /><div
                  class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center justify-center"
                >
                  <div
                    class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"
                  >
                    <i class="ri-eye-line text-gray-800 text-xl"></i>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div
                class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-6"
              >
                <span
                  class="inline-block bg-amber-600 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-2"
                  >Rejas</span
                ><h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg">
                  Reja Decorativa Residencial
                </h3>
              </div>
            </div><div
              class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"
            >
              <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
                <img
                  alt="Puerta Principal de Hierro"
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
                  src="https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=Magnificent%20wrought%20iron%20entrance%20door%20with%20ornate%20decorative%20metalwork%2C%20black%20iron%20gate%20with%20artistic%20flourishes%2C%20luxury%20residential%20entrance%2C%20professional%20installation%2C%20clean%20background%2C%20high%20quality%20architectural%20photography&width=600&height=400&seq=gallery-2&orientation=landscape"
                /><div
                  class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center justify-center"
                >
                  <div
                    class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"
                  >
                    <i class="ri-eye-line text-gray-800 text-xl"></i>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div
                class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-6"
              >
                <span
                  class="inline-block bg-amber-600 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-2"
                  >Puertas</span
                ><h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg">
                  Puerta Principal de Hierro
                </h3>
              </div>
            </div><div
              class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"
            >
              <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
                <img
                  alt="Escalera con Barandal Artístico"
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
                  src="https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=Beautiful%20curved%20metal%20staircase%20with%20artistic%20wrought%20iron%20railings%2C%20black%20iron%20handrails%20with%20decorative%20scrollwork%2C%20elegant%20interior%20design%2C%20professional%20craftsmanship%2C%20clean%20modern%20background%2C%20high%20quality%20architectural%20photography&width=600&height=400&seq=gallery-3&orientation=landscape"
                /><div
                  class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center justify-center"
                >
                  <div
                    class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"
                  >
                    <i class="ri-eye-line text-gray-800 text-xl"></i>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div
                class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-6"
              >
                <span
                  class="inline-block bg-amber-600 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-2"
                  >Escaleras</span
                ><h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg">
                  Escalera con Barandal Artístico
                </h3>
              </div>
            </div><div
              class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"
            >
              <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
                <img
                  alt="Estructura Metálica Industrial"
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
                  src="https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=Large%20industrial%20metal%20structure%20framework%2C%20steel%20beam%20construction%2C%20architectural%20metalwork%2C%20professional%20engineering%20project%2C%20construction%20site%2C%20clean%20industrial%20background%2C%20high%20quality%20construction%20photography&width=600&height=400&seq=gallery-4&orientation=landscape"
                /><div
                  class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center justify-center"
                >
                  <div
                    class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"
                  >
                    <i class="ri-eye-line text-gray-800 text-xl"></i>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div
                class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-6"
              >
                <span
                  class="inline-block bg-amber-600 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-2"
                  >Estructuras</span
                ><h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg">
                  Estructura Metálica Industrial
                </h3>
              </div>
            </div><div
              class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"
            >
              <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
                <img
                  alt="Ventana de Hierro Forjado"
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
                  src="https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=Traditional%20wrought%20iron%20window%20with%20decorative%20metalwork%2C%20black%20iron%20window%20frame%20with%20artistic%20patterns%2C%20classic%20architectural%20style%2C%20building%20facade%2C%20professional%20craftsmanship%2C%20clean%20background%2C%20high%20quality%20photography&width=600&height=400&seq=gallery-5&orientation=landscape"
                /><div
                  class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center justify-center"
                >
                  <div
                    class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"
                  >
                    <i class="ri-eye-line text-gray-800 text-xl"></i>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div
                class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-6"
              >
                <span
                  class="inline-block bg-amber-600 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-2"
                  >Ventanas</span
                ><h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg">
                  Ventana de Hierro Forjado
                </h3>
              </div>
            </div><div
              class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"
            >
              <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
                <img
                  alt="Mobiliario Metálico Decorativo"
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
                  src="https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=Custom%20wrought%20iron%20decorative%20furniture%2C%20black%20metal%20artistic%20bench%20with%20scrollwork%20design%2C%20outdoor%20garden%20furniture%2C%20professional%20craftsmanship%2C%20clean%20simple%20background%2C%20high%20quality%20product%20photography&width=600&height=400&seq=gallery-6&orientation=landscape"
                /><div
                  class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center justify-center"
                >
                  <div
                    class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"
                  >
                    <i class="ri-eye-line text-gray-800 text-xl"></i>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div
                class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-6"
              >
                <span
                  class="inline-block bg-amber-600 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-2"
                  >Mobiliario</span
                ><h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg">
                  Mobiliario Metálico Decorativo
                </h3>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section><section id="nosotros" class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">
                Tradición y Experiencia
              </h2><p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                Con más de 15 años de experiencia en el arte de la herrería, nos
                especializamos en crear piezas únicas que combinan la tradición
                artesanal con las técnicas más modernas.
              </p><p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                Nuestro compromiso es ofrecer productos de la más alta calidad,
                utilizando materiales premium y procesos que garantizan
                durabilidad y belleza en cada proyecto.
              </p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
                <div class="text-center">
                  <div
                    class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"
                  >
                    <i class="ri-hammer-line text-white text-2xl"></i>
                  </div><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">
                    Artesanía
                  </h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
                    Trabajo manual especializado
                  </p>
                </div><div class="text-center">
                  <div
                    class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3"
                  >
                    <i class="ri-shield-check-line text-white text-2xl"></i>
                  </div><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">
                    Calidad
                  </h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Materiales premium</p>
                </div>
              </div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                <button
                  class="bg-amber-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
                  >Conoce Más</button
                ><button
                  class="border-2 border-amber-600 text-amber-600 px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 hover:text-white transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
                  >Ver Trabajos</button
                >
              </div>
            </div><div class="relative">
              <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
                <img
                  alt="Maestro herrero trabajando"
                  class="w-full h-96 lg:h-[500px] object-cover object-top"
                  src="https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=Master%20blacksmith%20working%20at%20traditional%20forge%20with%20hammer%20and%20anvil%2C%20skilled%20craftsman%20shaping%20hot%20metal%2C%20workshop%20with%20authentic%20tools%20and%20equipment%2C%20warm%20orange%20glow%20from%20forge%20fire%2C%20professional%20artisan%20at%20work%2C%20detailed%20craftsmanship%20scene%2C%20high%20quality%20documentary%20photography&width=600&height=700&seq=about-blacksmith&orientation=portrait"
                /><div
                  class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/30 to-transparent"
                >
                </div>
              </div><div
                class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-xl p-6 max-w-xs"
              >
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                  <div
                    class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"
                  >
                    <i class="ri-award-line text-white text-xl"></i>
                  </div><div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800 text-lg">500+</h4><p
                      class="text-gray-600 text-sm"
                    >
                      Proyectos Completados
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-20">
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 text-center mb-12">
              Nuestros Valores
            </h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
              <div class="text-center">
                <div
                  class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"
                >
                  <i class="ri-star-line text-white text-2xl"></i>
                </div><h4 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">
                  Excelencia
                </h4><p class="text-gray-600">
                  Buscamos la perfección en cada detalle, desde el diseño hasta
                  la instalación final.
                </p>
              </div><div class="text-center">
                <div
                  class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"
                >
                  <i class="ri-time-line text-white text-2xl"></i>
                </div><h4 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">
                  Puntualidad
                </h4><p class="text-gray-600">
                  Cumplimos con los tiempos acordados sin comprometer la calidad
                  del trabajo.
                </p>
              </div><div class="text-center">
                <div
                  class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"
                >
                  <i class="ri-customer-service-line text-white text-2xl"></i>
                </div><h4 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">
                  Servicio
                </h4><p class="text-gray-600">
                  Atención personalizada y asesoría especializada en cada
                  proyecto.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
